Seatak
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 24 DEAL TAFO
TAFO 6 FACE_HALF
TAFO 8 FACE_HALF
TAFO 2 FACE_HALF
TAFO 1 FACE_HALF
TAFO 10 FACE_HALF
TAFO 1 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE TAFO TAFO
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
        SRC Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS}
    DEST Suit {HEARTS, SPADES, CLUBS}
DRAW
PILE ALL TAFO Size > 0
$win
PILE ALL TAFO Empty
